<span class="refAuthor">Google LLC</span>, <span class="refTitle">&quot;What is V8?&quot;</span>, <span>&lt;<a href="https://v8.dev/" rel="noopener" target="_blank" data-is-hyperlink data-non-rfc-anchor-link><!--[--><!--[-->https://v8<wbr class="wordsize-8">.dev/<!--]--><!--]--></a>&gt;</span>. </dd>
